    <h1>What is CodeBlog?</h1>
    <h2>
        CodeBlog is a clean and easy-to-use blogging platform where anyone can create, read, edit, and delete blog posts. 
        It's designed to be a simple space for sharing your thoughts, experiences, and ideas with others.
    </h2>






