        <h1 id="smaller-about-heading">
            Why does it exist?
        </h1>

        <h2>
            CodeBlog was built as a learning project to practice full-stack web development. 
            It brings together technologies like Node.js, Express, and EJS to create a functional web application.
        </h2>

